  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="8.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Af">Af</ref> 8.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gif hio leng libbe ðonne se ðe hie utlædde, nage hio his ierfes owiht.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If she outlives the man who took her out, she does not own any of his inheritance.</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">If she lives longer than he who abducted her, she shall inherit nothing of his property.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gif heo leng libbe ðonne se ðe heo útlædde, nage heo his yrfes owuht.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
